# NEXUS — Day 22 Engineering Log

## Objective

Build the controlled interface through which NEXUS can communicate with AI systems without exposing unrestricted application access.

---

# Problem

Day 21 introduced the Intelligence Orchestrator.

However, a major architectural question remained:

> How should an AI model interact with NEXUS?

A naive implementation would expose application APIs directly to an LLM.

NEXUS deliberately avoids this architecture.

